- Shit!


01:09:33.120 --> 01:09:34.161
Fuck!


01:09:34.162 --> 01:09:37.162
{GUN SHOOT #1}


01:09:37.163 --> 01:09:39.163
{GUN SHOOT #2}


01:09:51.200 --> 01:09:53.881
Really need to loosen that one up.


01:09:54.681 --> 01:09:57.161
Look out, world.
Jenna McCarty's up to her old tricks.


01:09:57.280 --> 01:10:00.481
Now, now. The only way to keep
