- Here you go, miss.


01:10:22.721 --> 01:10:24.881
You know that girl right there?
She's in accounting?


01:10:25.921 --> 01:10:29.441
l've seen her before, but l haven't
really met that many people yet, so-


01:10:29.561 --> 01:10:30.961
And what about you?


01:10:31.080 --> 01:10:35.121
l'm in operations, so,
pretty much the day-to-day stuff.


01:10:36.240 --> 01:10:38.201
