Elizabeth!


01:11:17.080 --> 01:11:18.921
Help!


01:11:19.040 --> 01:11:22.961
Look, l didn't wanna hurt your sister!
l don't wanna hurt you!


01:11:23.681 --> 01:11:26.961
Why are you making me do this?
Why won't you listen to me!


01:11:27.080 --> 01:11:28.761
Get off me!


01:11:34.120 --> 01:11:35.961
What the fuck?


01:11:39.921 --> 01:11:41.561
What the fuck?


01:11:47.480 --> 01:11:49.401
Honey, are you okay?


01:11:49.521 --> 01:11:51.321
- l just-
- What happened?


01:11:51.440 --> 01:11:53.121
- Hi, guys.
- Hey, boss.


01:11:53.240 --> 01:11:54.881
She's, you know, been drinking.


01:11:55.001 --> 01:11:58.761
Oh, no. Looks like somebody
had a little too much to drink.


01:12:00.881 --> 01:12:04.001
