- There we go.


01:12:09.961 --> 01:12:12.401
- You'll be fine.
- There we go.


01:12:12.521 --> 01:12:15.081
You'll be fine.
Just drink a lot of water.


01:12:16.160 --> 01:12:18.081
Have fun.


01:12:19.841 --> 01:12:21.001
Want a shot?


01:12:21.120 --> 01:12:22.881
- Yes, please.
- Two.


01:12:25.561 --> 01:12:28.561
- l left my purse at work.
- Okay, we'll go back. No problem.


01:12:28.681 --> 01:12:30.241
My keys.


01:12:31.160 --> 01:12:32.721
Wait.


01:12:34.120 --> 01:12:36.121
- Where are we going?
- There you go.


01:12:42.521 --> 01:12:45.441
l'm goanna get you home
safe and sound.


01:12:45.561 --> 01:12:47.441
l have to go home?


01:13:01.761 --> 01:13:06.121
And here we are.
Let's get your keys and get you home.


01:13:08.601 --> 01:13:09.921
l just feel so-


01:13:21.022 --> 01:13:24.922
{MAONING}


01:13:38.400 --> 01:13:40.761
- No, no, no.
- Get off me!


01:13:42.160 --> 01:13:44.601
Get off me!
Get off me!


01:13:44.721 --> 01:13:45.801
Stop it!


01:13:57.561 --> 01:14:02.081
We need to talk about this!
Eleanor, we need to talk about this!


01:14:03.641 --> 01:14:07.081
Eleanor! Where are you going?
Come here!


01:14:07.200 --> 01:14:09.241
l just wanna talk to you!


01:14:16.921 --> 01:14:18.761
l just wanna talk to you!


01:14:30.240 --> 01:14:31.521
What?


01:14:36.440 --> 01:14:39.121
