- Shut up!


01:14:55.561 --> 01:14:57.121
l can't let this happen.


01:14:58.280 --> 01:14:59.161
Walk!


01:15:12.280 --> 01:15:14.321
l just wanna talk to you!


01:15:16.222 --> 01:15:18.822
 Eleanor!


01:15:20.961 --> 01:15:23.121
l swear to Christ,
l'm not goanna hurt you!


01:15:27.400 --> 01:15:29.881
l just wanna talk.


01:15:30.001 --> 01:15:32.841
l just think you're
a little confused, that's all.


01:15:32.842 --> 01:15:34.842
 Eleanor!


01:16:06.400 --> 01:16:08.321
Get down there, Eleanor!


01:16:08.440 --> 01:16:11.641
- Eleanor?
- l just want to talk.


01:16:11.761 --> 01:16:13.721
You're goanna ruin everything!


01:16:14.561 --> 01:16:16.481
Get off of me!


01:16:21.761 --> 01:16:23.721
