01:17:06.360 --> 01:17:08.721
l'm so stupid!


01:17:09.841 --> 01:17:11.041
l'm so stupid!


01:17:11.280 --> 01:17:14.001
Help! Get off me!


01:17:20.120 --> 01:17:22.161
Get off me!


01:17:32.062 --> 01:17:33.562
{GUN SHOOT #1}


01:17:33.563 --> 01:17:34.563
{GUN SHOOT #2


01:17:35.120 --> 01:17:37.001
Get back, Elizabeth!


01:17:38.801 --> 01:17:41.361
