01:21:17.681 --> 01:21:20.081
That was the easiest
interrogation ever.


01:21:20.200 --> 01:21:21.761
l don't know, Pic.


01:21:21.881 --> 01:21:25.321
First time l ever played
good cop, good cop though.


01:21:29.521 --> 01:21:31.401
